/*  EXPECTED: REJECTED at type-check, identically by both backends.

    Written to attack the store rules (2026-11-17 review): swap through two parameters. A rabbit's series reaches
    something that outlives the rabbit (docs/SOUNDNESS.md, obligation O4). */

Bind void to cross, given (the series of series of number left, the series of series of number right):
    For each row in left, repeat:
        Insert row into right.
    Done.
Done.
Define keeper as a series of series of number.
Pull a rabbit.
    Define inner as a series of series of number.
    Insert (a series of number with (1, 2, 3)) into inner.
    Cast cross on (inner, keeper).
Done.

Define churn as a series of text.
Define tick as 0.
While tick is less than 400, repeat:
    Insert ("zzzzzzzz" joined to "yyyyyyyy") into churn.
    tick becomes tick + 1.
Done.
State keeper.
